
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Environment variables and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Database files
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ChromaDB and generated data
chroma_db/
storage/
data/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# IDE and operating system
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Tests and coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Logs
*.log

# Build and packaging artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
```

**Important:** `.env.example` remains publishable, while your actual `.env` stays private.

Save with **Ctrl + S**.

Reply **done** when saved.